			"notes": "**Unofficial** rebuild of Anubis 0.9.9.1 by **4ldenz**, compiled from the decompiled source in this repo. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original author. GPL-3.0-only.\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft **1.21.11**\n- Fabric Loader **0.16.0+**\n- **Fabric API** (the mod relies on its access wideners)\n\n## Differences from the original jar\n- Same classes, metadata, mixin configs and bundled libraries. Every class references the same Minecraft names as the original.\n- Fixes an original bug: `CharacterLayer` and `PharaohHeaddressLayer` rendering, and `SeedWorldgen`'s biome lookup, used method names that never overrode Minecraft's methods.\n\n## Checksum\n`anubis-0.9.9.1+mc1.21.11.jar` SHA-256: `93060fd812017cbdf5efe06bdf64e7b2c44a8d0728f189e9b65bd52086aab635`\n\nBuilt from commit f7acc72 with `gradlew build` (JDK 25, release target 21)."
